#. y1:english="Oh... Thank you, Kazuma-san...\nWhat do you mean?\nThat girl they mentioned a little bit ago,||Azusa... She's my childhood friend.\nShe seems to have been strapped for cash and||ended up borrowing money from a loan shark.\nSo, those were debt collectors...\nI was the one that told Azusa||to bail out on the debt...\nBecause she got scammed||and was up to her neck in interest.\nBut after Azusa ran away,||the debt collectors came to me\nand asked me where Azusa was...\n...What are you gonna do now?\nI don't know, but I have a little bit saved||up. Maybe I should go back to my hometown.❤\nOh, I see.\nI have to apologise for||what happened today, Kazuma-san.\nI'm sorry I got you involved...\nDon't worry about it.||Stuff like this always happens to me.\nTeehee.||I better hurry up and pack my stuff.\nI'm sorry, Kazuma-san...||I have to go home today...\nYeah...\n"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/RAIN_KAB0045.BIN:81_5_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/RAIN_KAB0045.BIN::line:81_5_0"
msgid "Oh... gracias, Kazuma-san..."
msgstr ""

