#. y1:english="A... {PA:10}Aniki... {PA:10}You're too strong...\nI'll be honoured if you're the one||that kills me.{PA:20}➿Please kill me...\nI was called for a big job by that guy.\nI went there and found out...{PA:10}||it was a suicide mission.\nHe told me that you were the target.\nHe seemed to know that||I've been hanging around you...\nSo,{PA:10}||they thought I could catch you off guard.\nAfter he told me about the assignment,{PA:10}\nhe told me he'd throw me into Tokyo Bay||if I refused.\nSo, I... {PA:10}had to...\nWho are they?\n...They're working for the Tojo Clan.{PA:20}||I don't know which family they belong to.\nI see...\nI'm prepared for anything.{PA:20}||I betrayed you.\nMy life is worthless...{PA:10}||Do with me as you wish...\nIt's not worth it.\nBut, {PA:10}Aniki...\nThen, {PA:10}the least you could do||is have me cut my pinky off...!\nI told you it's not worth it.\nAniki...!{PA:10}\nOh man. {PA:10}I realised a real Yakuza||is a big hearted person.\nAniki, {PA:10}I wash my hands of the underworld.\nI've been trying to live honourably...\nbut all I've been doing is fucking off{MS:0}||like some little bitch.\nEven though it was a short period of time,{PA:10}||I'm glad to have worked under you, Aniki.\nHere is a token of my gratitude.\n\nPlease just take it.\nYou received 200,000 yen.\nYou received \"Musashi's Dagger\".\n\nI got that dagger through a net auction.\nI know it's genuine...{PA:10}||But I don't need it anymore.\nThank you very much for everything, {PA:10}Aniki!||I'll never forget what you've done for me!\nYou gained 2,000 exp.\n\nI'll make sure your death is painful.\nWhat? {PA:10}Are you serious?{PA:10}||You're gonna go that far?\n...I understand.{PA:20}||I betrayed you.\nMy life is worthless...{PA:10}||Do with me as you wish..."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/RAIN_KAB0045.BIN:85_1_38
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/RAIN_KAB0045.BIN::line:85_1_38"
msgid "... Comprendo.{PA:20}||Te he traicionado."
msgstr ""

